Modified by BizBox: added web dashboard.
  - web/: a browser dashboard for TradingAgents runs (run setup, live run view,
    final report, past runs), an adapter for the run output the framework
    writes, a bundled SAMPLE run for preview (fictional ticker DEMO, marked
    "SAMPLE — illustrative, not real analysis"), and a server-side bridge stub
    (web/bridge/server.py).
  - docs/design/refero/wealthsimple/: the design tokens the dashboard is styled
    with (style reference only; no third-party logos or marks are used).
  - README.md: a section describing these changes.
No file of the original framework under tradingagents/ or cli/ was changed.

The dashboard is a research tool. It is not financial advice, and it places no
orders: it has no broker integration.
